A modern, minimalist vector illustration of Tux (the Linux penguin mascot). Tux is stylized, looking friendly and efficient. He is standing, holding a cloud-shaped icon in his hands. The cloud has two circular arrows forming a sync loop inside it. The overall style is clean, digital, and uses a fresh color palette (penguin black/white/yellow accents, and light blue/white for the cloud and sync arrows). (Simulated PNG content)